// Ch13 B10 "The pact" (C, 2.5 min) and B11 "Sefir closes the book" (C, 0.5 min). act2_ch13.md §2. A11: day
// 4, the outer moorings, lamps on poles over still black water; Kerrid is standing where he always stands;
// he turns when they come. A12: Tobin has followed his sister out; Liss tells him in a whisper; he refuses,
// sincerely and not stupidly. A13: Kerrid watching the still water (he knows what it is to hold a gate past
// the hour). A14: wide. B11 (R10): Sefir alone in the Archive squares Liss's row of pages, closes the
// ledger, puts out the lamp. Not a gloat: a man tidying up, who expected this (rule 6).
title: ch13_the_pact
location: ch13/ansedra
---
@letterbox on
@camera A11
@music ansedra fade=2.0
@anim kerrid look_at party
@wait 2.0
Liss [determined]: Tobin's married tomorrow. Then we get him out. Then we say it. All of it. Not before. #line:ch13_pact_001
Toma [neutral]: If we say it before, they will not let him marry. They will not let him leave. #line:ch13_pact_002
Rhen [neutral]: So we smile at the wedding. #line:ch13_pact_003
Ysolde [cold]: We have all smiled at worse. #line:ch13_pact_004
Asha [worried]: And the High Warden? #line:ch13_pact_005
@wait 4.0
@camera A12
@mark tobin outer_moorings walk
@anim liss whisper tobin
@wait 3.0
Tobin [determined]: No. #line:ch13_pact_006
Tobin [tender]: If I run, there's no peace. Hollowmere's captains are here, Liss. They came because I said it was safe. #line:ch13_pact_007
Tobin [tender]: If I run the night before, they're all hostages. If I marry her, they go home as family. #line:ch13_pact_008
@wait 1.5
Tobin [soft_smile]: Somebody has to go first. #line:ch13_pact_009
Liss [grief]: Tobin. #line:ch13_pact_010
Tobin [smile]: One day. Then you can get me out of whatever you like. #line:ch13_pact_011
@camera A13
@wait 3.0
@camera A14
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch13_pact_of_silence = true>>
<<jump ch13_sefir_closes_the_book>>
===
title: ch13_sefir_closes_the_book
---
@camera R10
@music silence fade=2.0
@mark sefir reading_table walk
@wait 2.0
@anim sefir square_pages
@wait 2.0
@anim sefir close_ledger
@wait 1.5
@light archive_lamp off 1.0
@wait 2.0
<<set $ch13_complete = true>>
@letterbox off
===
